Z||000002||mrfiero||03-11-2001||03:19 PM||||No one, other than GM, makes UBJ's for the '88 Fiero.  They are still available through GM.......so buy some spares now.  <P>The good news is that you rarely need to replace the UBJ's, so the cost should be irrelevant.||||reg||1
